{"id":"msg_m_ex_yulha_01","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_yulha","label":"Yulha · Nikke"},"label":"1. Are you","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":"msg_m_ex_yulha_02","speakers":{"yulha":"Yulha"},"icons":{"yulha":"si_c171_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_1","text":"Are you","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_2","text":"the Commander","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_3","text":"who requested my support?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_4","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_4","text":"??","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_5","text":"What are those question marks supposed to mean?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_6","text":"You called for me, didn't you?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_7","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_7","text":"Yes, I did.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_8","text":"Well then?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_9","text":"How come you can't give me a straight answer?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_10","text":"My superiors are always stressing how I should take things seriously,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_11","text":"but I don't see the point in it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_12","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_12","text":"I'm sorry?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_13","text":"What for?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_14","text":"Who taught you to use question marks like that?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_15","text":"Listen,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_16","text":"Newbie,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_17","text":"you mustn't apologize to Nikkes so profusely.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_18","text":"That is, never get on any Nikke's bad side.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_19","text":"Raptures aren't the only way","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_20","text":"Commanders can perish.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_21","text":"If you're unable to keep a firm grasp on your Nikkes, like you're failing to now,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_22","text":"they can overtake you at any moment.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_23","text":"They'll kill you","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_24","text":"the moment they have the opportunity.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_25","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_25","text":"Thank you for your concern.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_26","text":"Now you're thanking me?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_27","text":"You really are a goodie-two-shoes.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_28","text":"You need to toughen up.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_29","text":"Get yourself together.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_30","text":"Or you'll be done in by one Nikke or another.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_31","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_31","text":"I'll be in your care from now on.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_32","text":"Oh, really?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_33","text":"You idiot.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_34","text":"I told you don't to give a Nikke any kind of opening.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_35","text":"Are you even listening?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_36","text":"Now I see why you weigh so heavy on my superior's mind.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_37","text":"All right.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_38","text":"Fine.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_39","text":"You're under the spotlight, that much is certain.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_40","text":"Let's just hope you the attention you get","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_41","text":"will end up being positive.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_42","text":"That way we'll be able to","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_43","text":"collaborate properly.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_yulha_01_44","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_yulha_01_44","text":"I'll keep that in mind.","jump":null}],"chat":true}